BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Halcyon HX-200 User Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-hx200-user-manual | Revision: D | Effective: 2025-01-20 | Owner: Halcyon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Product Engineering, Leeds | Applies to firmware 3.2.4) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Safety information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (Read this manual in full before using the Halcyon HX-200 portable single-gas detector. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (HX-200 is personal protective equipment. It warns the wearer of hazardous concentrations of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (hydrogen sulphide \(H2S\). It does not remove any hazard, and it cannot warn of any other gas.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 593 Td (The HX-200 is certified intrinsically safe with the marking II 2G Ex ib IIB T4 Gb. It may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (used in Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas for gas groups IIA and IIB only, with temperature) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (class T4. It must not be used in Zone 0 or in gas group IIC atmospheres such as hydrogen or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (acetylene. The ATEX certificate is Baseefa21ATEX0147X and the IECEx certificate is IECEx BAS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (21.0063X.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 519 Td (- Charge the instrument only in a safe \(non-hazardous\) area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (- Replace the battery pack HX-BAT-200 only in a safe area. Do not use any other battery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (   pack.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (- Do not open the housing in a hazardous area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (- Substitution of components may impair intrinsic safety.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (- Perform a bump test before each day's use. Calibrate at least every 180 days, or sooner if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 441 Td (   a bump test fails.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 425 Td (2. Product overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (The Halcyon HX-200 is the single-gas member of the Halcyon family. It continuously monitors H2S) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (with an electrochemical sensor, part number HX-SNS-H2S-02, over a range of 0-100 ppm with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (resolution of 0.1 ppm. The four-gas HX-210 and the connected HX-220 share the same sensor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 364 Td (controls and menu structure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (The housing is rated IP66 and weighs 210 g including the battery. Dimensions are 98 x 55 x 32) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 329 Td (mm. The operating temperature range is -20 to +50 C.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 304 Td (3. Package contents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (The HX-200 starter kit, part number HX-200-KIT-01, contains the HX-200 detector with H2S sensor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269 Td (fitted and calibrated, the HX-BAT-200 rechargeable Li-ion battery pack \(2,600 mAh, fitted\), a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 256 Td (single-unit USB-C charger, calibration cap HX-CAP-200 with hose, a belt clip, a printed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 243 Td (quick-start guide and a factory calibration certificate.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 218 Td (4. Controls and indicators) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 196 Td (The HX-200 has one large push button on the front \(ON/OK\) and two smaller buttons below the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 183 Td (display \(UP and DOWN\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 161 Td (- ON/OK: press and hold for 3 seconds to switch on; press and hold for 5 seconds to switch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148 Td (   off.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 135 Td (- UP: press and hold in measuring mode to display the peak reading.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 122 Td (- DOWN: press and hold in measuring mode to display STEL and TWA values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109 Td (Two red LEDs flash during alarms, a green LED flashes every 10 seconds as the confidence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 96 Td (signal, and a yellow LED lights when calibration or bump test is overdue. The sounder produces) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83 Td (95 dB at 30 cm.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 58 Td (5. Charging and power-on) Tj ET
endstream
