BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (that can occur on the HX-200 include E-101, E-104, E-108, E-111, E-122, E-126 and E-140. Codes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 656 Td (E-113, E-117 and E-131 do not apply to the HX-200 because it has no pump, no LEL sensor and no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 643 Td (Bluetooth module.) Tj ET
